"entity": {
"name": "Somnigroup International Inc.",
"description": "Somnigroup International, Inc. engages in developing, manufacturing, marketing, and distributing bedding products. Its brands include Tempur, Tempur-Pedic, Sealy,Stearns and Foster, and Sleepy's. It operates through the following segments: Mattress Firm, Tempur Sealy North America and Tempur Sealy International. The Mattress Firm segment engages in the direct sale of mattresses, bedding products, and related sleep accessories through company-owned stores, online platforms, and call centers. The Tempur Sealy North America and International segments engage in the manufacture, marketing, and distribution of mattresses, bedding products, and sleep solutions through direct-to-consumer and wholesale channels across North American and global markets. The company was founded by Robert B. Trussell, Jr. in 1991 and is headquartered in Dallas, TX.",
